{"server":"tw","storyId":"act9d0_level_act9d0_03_beg","groupId":"act9d0","stageId":"act9d0_03","title":"擠壓","storyCode":"DM-3","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act9d0/level_act9d0_03_beg.txt","sourceHash":"9ab3681ddb3d1cb25820a4835600644af626ec35862db89e0052efb628ae4860","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac9_8"},{"type":"narration","text":"那些薩卡茲都停下了。\n燃燒著的廢墟向中心擠壓過來，那些怪物一樣的敵人居高臨下。\n在這場包圍中心的，是一個突兀出現的女性，一個......古怪的人。\n她不是薩卡茲，但是就那麼隻身站在戰場的正中心，面不改色。\n伊內絲在顫抖，我可猜不出她是為了什麼顫抖。\n聽力似乎因為爆炸稍有受損，我聽不清他們在說什麼。\n但是我知道，他們在畏懼。\n是因為面前這個人嗎？\n不是，所有人都看著另一個方向，都看著另一個人。\n在我失去意識的最後一秒，我看到了——\n一個......薩卡茲。\n毫無敵意的......纖細的薩卡茲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他們......臨時......\n薩卡茲......必須......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"......你要......什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她的傷很重......如果我們不在這裡做緊急處理......\n......如果......他......會找到這裡......我們沒有時間......\n......凱爾希，來搭把手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"......唉，好吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"船上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"船......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......我們怎麼還活著？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"你想自嘲能不能不要帶上我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"簡單來說，我們被救下了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......那這裡是哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"運輸隊本隊，我們一直護送的就是這艘艦船，現在臨時收納了一些傷患。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"看樣子都是些正在搭建中的設施，真是不明白這艘船是什麼構造，聞所未聞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"（但是那時候看見的影子，確實是......還是別深究了吧。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......赫德雷呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......他在和雇主......不，他在和......和這裡的主人談判。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"也對，既然你還願意乖乖待在這裡，那赫德雷肯定沒事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，這裡的主人是怎麼回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"你好像很緊張，我不需要你那種有害視力的源石技藝就能感覺到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"……你不會以為，我待在這裡真的是在關心你吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"我想也不是，那是為了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"我現在，稍微有點可憐他了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"那間屋子裡的，都是些什麼妖魔鬼怪......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_npc_049","isRemote":false,"text":"......你不用這麼緊張，會影響到會議的效率。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_npc_049","isRemote":false,"text":"你們盡力做到了最好，而洩露了情報是我們的失誤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"......戰場上無論對錯，我很清楚我們在和誰作對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_npc_049","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"可我沒想到那位指揮官......原來真的是殿下身邊的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"您的......那種力量也讓我深感意外，我還沒有為您出手相助正式道謝，凱爾希醫生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_npc_049","isRemote":false,"text":"謝特蕾西婭吧，是她的意思。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"殿下——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡不是卡茲戴爾，不必多禮，我們坐下談吧，赫德雷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"......遵命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"那您身邊的這位就是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"希望你不要介意，任何戰略情報博士都必須瞭若指掌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_047","isRemote":false,"text":"感謝理解。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"（真的是一艘艦船......這個規模不算小了吧......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"（有些設施看上去是全新的，有些地方又破舊的讓人無法靠近......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"（我記得......這是從雷姆必拓......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嬌小的卡特斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_051","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！抱、抱歉，這前面的設施還在施工......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嬌小的卡特斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_051","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希醫生說過......不要隨便去更深處的地方，會很危險......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"哼嗯——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，那我就換條路吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嬌小的卡特斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_051","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......真有禮貌啊，那雙耳朵，果然不是薩卡茲吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"說起來，那個比伊內絲還討人厭的女人，好像是個醫生來著？也不是薩卡茲......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡到底是怎麼回事，明明身在戰場的中心，盡是些薩卡茲之外的——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"怎麼又卡住了啊！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"唔？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"冷、冷靜點，可露希爾，不過是今天的第七次短路——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_050","isRemote":false,"text":"第——七——次——短——路——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_050","isRemote":false,"text":"這對天才工程師來說是莫大的恥辱！要不要考慮重新買一批門！那樣比較快！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"誒......因為多出了許多傷患，他們的伙食也需要緊急採購，人手和預算方面都......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"而且你就這麼放棄，難道就不算恥辱了......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_050","isRemote":false,"text":"咕嗚嗚嗚——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_050","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼！殿下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_050","isRemote":false,"text":"給我三天時間，三天！既然怎麼都修不好，乾脆把整個保全控制系統拆了重裝！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"重、重裝？可行嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_050","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然不知道是誰造了這些不明所以的系統還埋在雷姆必拓地下深處，但既然弄不明白——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_050","isRemote":false,"text":"——就把它替換成可以弄明白的！非常簡單的道理！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"......那，就交給你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_050","isRemote":false,"text":"收到！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島......還要很久才能投入使用嗎......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"你是......我記得是和赫德雷一起的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"你醒了嗎？你之前傷的很重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"（她剛才那算是被嚇到了嗎......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"傭兵W，我在找赫德雷隊長，然後不小心迷路——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"偵查的時候要留神點，有些區域還在施工，電纜都裸露在外，小心觸電。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"不過這種程度的謹慎應該也算是你們雇傭兵的天性了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"W，是嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"叫我特蕾西婭吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"赫德雷在會議結束後和博士聊了兩句，現在應該已經回到臨時病房了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"不要讓同伴太擔心，你也回去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......特蕾西婭......殿下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？啊，這裡不是卡茲戴爾，不必拘謹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"那特蕾西婭......殿下為什麼要在這兒和一堵門較勁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才那個小個子是個工程師吧，這點小事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"這也不是件小事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"是......嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"有多少事是真的不值得去關注的呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......那羅德島是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，你聽見了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"是這艘船的名字，雖然還沒有正式的命名儀式，我......想這麼稱呼它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"只是一廂情願而已，說不定博士和凱爾希會反對用它的“本名”呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈，本名？這艘船的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"你也看見了，這艘船並非卡茲戴爾所製造。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"在最深處，尚且殘留下的資料裡，我翻閱到了這個名字......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"“羅德島”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不知道這到底意味著什麼，嗯......凱爾希應該懂得多一些吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"但我想這麼命名它。既然它已經有了名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"（和篡奪卡茲戴爾的攝政王分庭抗禮......幾乎憑一己之力重新統合了大半薩卡茲門閥的特蕾西婭殿下......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"（正在親自修復一扇斷了電的自動門？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼了？表情有點奇怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"在殿下面前笑出聲來......算不算僭越？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不算吧......不過凱爾希和博士都是不苟言笑的......戰士們背負著很多，也不太容易敞開心扉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"如果可以的話，我倒希望你們都可以展露笑容。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"但這是一種不負責任的奢望，我不能忽視壓在大家身上的重擔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"那我笑一會應該沒事吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，請？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"不，這樣我突然笑不出來了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"總覺得是我的錯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵......咳，不敢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"那你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"我是特蕾西婭，它是羅德島，你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"“W”......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"不是說那個，“W”只代表一個雇傭兵。你的名字才能代表你自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"不要讓這種沾滿戰火氣息的偽裝持續太久，不光是說名字，就算是我多管閒事吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"你沒有自己的名字嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"對在卡茲戴爾出生的薩卡茲來說，這是件稀鬆平常的事情吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"很少有薩卡茲會這麼在意......名字。被遺忘的速度太快，花力氣去記住那麼多人的本名是很沒效率的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想忘記他們，也不能忘記他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"如果等到卡茲戴爾的命運塵埃落定......等到你不再是“W”，而我們還有機會這樣交談的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"說不定你可以擁有一個更好的名字，更適合你這樣的薩卡茲女性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"就像羅德島一樣，如果有個名字的話，聽上去就溫暖多了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒想過這種......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_npc_049","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西婭，通訊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_npc_049","isRemote":false,"text":"卡茲戴爾有動作，博士已經在著手佈置了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我馬上就去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"W？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，嗯，我在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_056","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你還願意為我們而戰，無論你那時在做什麼，這裡都隨時歡迎你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_npc_049","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_npc_049","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會對特蕾西婭的決定指手畫腳，但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_npc_049","isRemote":false,"text":"不要以為你會在這裡大受歡迎，我看過你的全部履歷，你很危險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，彼此彼此？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_npc_049","isRemote":false,"text":"......你的身體恢復得很快，但還遠遠沒到可以隨意閒逛的程度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_npc_049","isRemote":false,"text":"回到你的病榻上去，否則會有人把你扛回去的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"事後我才意識到。\n我從頭到尾，都沒敢正視特蕾西婭的眼睛。\n為什麼呢。\n她看上去明明那麼天真。\n根本不像是主持了這場殘酷戰爭的領袖之一......\n天真......嗎？\n但天真的人可不會有那種眼神......那種......悲傷的......\n......她的身邊似乎總是環繞著那兩個人。\n如果......我能和他們站在一起......\n我會看見什麼樣的風景呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"（那個兜帽......是他們嘴裡的“博士”？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"（是不是看向這邊了......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"（......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"（怎麼回事......為什麼......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"（我在害怕？怕什麼？他給人的感覺就是普通的......不，太模糊了，我沒見過這樣詭異的人......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"（啊......巴別塔的戰地指揮官，我好像想起來了......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"（“博士”，是嗎。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"我開始明白伊內絲為什麼不敢靠近殿下了。\n也許我也該擔憂一下，才是對自己好吧。\n但是......不知道為什麼，啊，對於特蕾西婭的事情，我好像總是不知道為什麼......\n就當是心血來潮吧，赫德雷他們會理解的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
